{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "grp-stage1",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "STAGE 1 | Multimodal Foundation & VLM Reasoning",
      "x": -1360,
      "y": -440,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 1100,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-stage1-vla",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \ud83d\udc41\ufe0f STAGE 1A | Vision-Language-Action Domain\n> \ud83d\udd17 **[[topics/vla-and-physical-ai-robotics/00-vla-and-physical-ai-robotics-moc|Open VLA Robotics MOC \u2197]]**\n\n### Foundation Paradigms\n- **Foundations**: OpenVLA 7B, pi_0 Flow Matching, Octo, Florence-2\n- **Tokenization**: Continuous visual patch projection + language instruction\n- **Action Outputs**: 7-DoF end-effector trajectory deltas $[dx, dy, dz, dR, dP, dY, g]$\n- **Control Rate**: $50\\text{ Hz}$ Cartesian Impedance Control\n- **Production Guide**: [[topics/vla-and-physical-ai-robotics/README|Physical AI Robotics Playbook]]",
      "x": -1320,
      "y": -380,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-stage1-florence",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f ARCHITECTURE | Florence-2 Unified Vision\n> \ud83d\udd17 **[[architectures/multimodal-vlm-and-vla/florence-2|Open Architecture Deep-Dive \u2197]]**\n\n### Unified Vision-Language Foundation\n- **Capabilities**: Zero-shot prompt grounding, captioning, dense object detection\n- **Backbone**: DaViT hierarchical vision transformer + autoregressive LM\n- **Throughput**: $32.0\\text{ ms}$ on edge GPU ($0.23\\text{B} / 0.77\\text{B}$ parameters)\n- **License**: MIT Commercial Permissive License",
      "x": -1320,
      "y": -10,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 310,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-stage1-openvla",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f ARCHITECTURE | OpenVLA 7B Foundation\n> \ud83d\udd17 **[[architectures/multimodal-vlm-and-vla/openvla|Open Architecture Deep-Dive \u2197]]**\n\n### Open-Source Visuomotor Transformer\n- **Backbone**: Llama-2 7B + dual-fused SigLIP / DINOv2 vision tokens\n- **Training Corpus**: Open X-Embodiment dataset (970k robot trajectories)\n- **Inference Optimization**: 4-bit AWQ quantization on Jetson AGX Orin ($12\\text{ FPS}$)\n- **License**: Apache-2.0 Commercial Safe",
      "x": -1320,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "grp-stage2",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "STAGE 2 | Action Chunking & Visuomotor Trajectory Policies",
      "x": -680,
      "y": -440,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 1100,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-stage2-actcb",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \ud83e\uddbe STAGE 2A | ACT Trajectory Chunking\n> \ud83d\udd17 **[[cookbooks/20-act-trajectory-chunking/README|Open Cookbook 20 Playbook \u2197]]**\n\n### Trajectory Chunking Mechanics\n- **Architecture**: Action Chunking with C-VAE + Temporal Ensembling\n- **Action Horizon**: $H = 50$ trajectory steps predicted in a single forward pass\n- **Temporal Blending**: Exponential decay weighting $\\exp(-m \\cdot i)$ avoids jerk\n- **Throughput**: $50\\text{ Hz}$ live control frequency ($<20\\text{ ms}$ latency budget)\n- **Production Guide**: [[topics/visual-guidance-and-robotics/README|Visual Guidance Playbook]]",
      "x": -640,
      "y": -380,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-stage2-actarch",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f ARCHITECTURE | ACT (Action Chunking)\n> \ud83d\udd17 **[[architectures/multimodal-vlm-and-vla/act|Open Architecture Deep-Dive \u2197]]**\n\n### Multi-Camera Visuomotor Architecture\n- **Vision Encoder**: ResNet-18 multi-view camera encoder + joint state MLP\n- **Latent Space**: Conditional VAE modeling multimodal human demonstrations\n- **Benchmark**: $84.7\\%$ task success on ALOHA bimanual manipulation tasks\n- **License**: BSD 3-Clause / Apache-2.0",
      "x": -640,
      "y": -10,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 310,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-stage2-diffusion",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f ARCHITECTURE | Diffusion Policy\n> \ud83d\udd17 **[[architectures/multimodal-vlm-and-vla/diffusion-policy|Open Architecture Deep-Dive \u2197]]**\n\n### Visuomotor Score-Based Diffusion\n- **Paradigm**: Expresses robot policies via continuous Denoising Diffusion\n- **Multimodal Advantage**: Resolves multi-modal demonstrations without mode collapse\n- **Inference Sampling**: 10-step DDIM fast trajectory sampling ($80\\text{ Hz}$)\n- **License**: MIT Commercial Permissive License",
      "x": -640,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "grp-stage3",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "STAGE 3 | Spatial Scene Memory & 3DGS Lie SLAM",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -440,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 1100,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-stage3-slamcb",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \ud83d\udccd STAGE 3A | 3DGS Lie SLAM\n> \ud83d\udd17 **[[cookbooks/18-3dgs-lie-slam/README|Open Cookbook 18 Playbook \u2197]]**\n\n### Continuous Gaussian Radiance Fields\n- **Scene Model**: Metric 3D Gaussian ellipsoids $(\\mu, \\Sigma, c, \\alpha)$\n- **Tracking Engine**: Analytical Lie algebra $\\mathfrak{se}(3)$ photometric Jacobian\n- **Rendering**: Real-time tile-based differentiable rasterization ($>30\\text{ FPS}$)\n- **Precision**: Sub-centimeter ATE tracking error in untextured indoor environments\n- **Production Guide**: [[topics/slam-and-spatial-perception/README|Spatial SLAM Playbook]]",
      "x": 40,
      "y": -380,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-stage3-slamarch",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f ARCHITECTURE | 3DGS-SLAM & MonoGS\n> \ud83d\udd17 **[[architectures/spatial-radiance-and-slam/3dgs-slam|Open Architecture Deep-Dive \u2197]]**\n\n### Real-Time Radiance SLAM\n- **Keyframing**: Covisibility graph expansion and geometric entropy pruning\n- **Memory Model**: Explicit point-based Gaussian primitives (no neural hash grids)\n- **Benchmark**: $1.8\\text{ cm}$ Absolute Trajectory Error on Replica dataset\n- **License**: Apache-2.0 / Inria Commercial License",
      "x": 40,
      "y": -10,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 310,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-stage3-affordance",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f 3D SPATIAL AFFORDANCE MEMORY\n\n### Spatial Scene Specifications\n- **World Frame**: Metric Cartesian frame attached to robot base origin\n- **Affordance Query**: 3D ray-casting for obstacle clearance and grasping\n- **Trajectory Feasibility**: Continuous collision checking against Gaussian bounds\n- **Dynamic Updating**: Incremental densification and pruning during motion",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "grp-stage4",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "STAGE 4 | Control Barrier Safety & Sim2Real Adaptation",
      "x": 680,
      "y": -440,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 1100,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-stage4-cbf",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f STAGE 4A | Control Barrier Filter (CBF-QP)\n> \ud83d\udd17 **[[cookbooks/08-control-barrier-filter/README|Open Cookbook 08 Playbook \u2197]]**\n\n### Unsafe Action Interception\n- **Safety Invariant**: Nagumo condition $\\dot{h}(x) \\ge -\\alpha h(x)$ guarantees safety set $\\mathcal{C}$\n- **Optimization**: Solves convex Quadratic Program in $<50\\ \\mu\\text{s}$ at $10\\text{ kHz}$\n- **Intervention**: Minimally invasive projection of unverified neural action $u_{\\text{deep}}$\n- **Application**: Prevents manipulator collisions with workspace boundaries\n- **Production Guide**: [[topics/safety-verification-and-robustness/README|Safety Playbook]]",
      "x": 720,
      "y": -380,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-stage4-sim2real",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \ud83c\udfaf STAGE 4B | Contrastive Sim2Real Alignment\n> \ud83d\udd17 **[[cookbooks/10-contrastive-sim2real-alignment/README|Open Cookbook 10 Playbook \u2197]]**\n\n### Domain Invariant Latent Space\n- **Loss Function**: Supervised Contrastive Loss (SupCon) / InfoNCE\n- **Alignment Target**: Bridges Unreal Engine 5 renders and physical camera crops\n- **Metric**: $+1.17$ cosine separation improvement on real target objects\n- **Zero Hallucination**: Prevents policy failure from lighting and texture shifts",
      "x": 720,
      "y": -10,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 310,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-stage4-cbm",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \ud83d\udd0d STAGE 4C | Mechanistic Concept Bottleneck\n> \ud83d\udd17 **[[cookbooks/06-mechanistic-cbm-attribution/README|Open Cookbook 06 Playbook \u2197]]**\n\n### Test-Time Human Intervention\n- **Interpretable Layer**: Bottleneck concept activations $c = f(x)$ before policy $y = g(c)$\n- **Intervention**: Real-time human override of false intermediate visual concepts\n- **Regulatory**: $100\\%$ linear attribution compliance for EU AI Act safety\n- **Production Guide**: [[topics/explainability-and-interpretability/README|Explainability Guide]]",
      "x": 720,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "grp-stage5",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "STAGE 5 | Edge Robotics Silicon Hardware",
      "x": 1360,
      "y": -440,
      "width": 540,
