      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-stage5-thor",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \ud83e\udd16 HARDWARE | NVIDIA Jetson Thor\n> \ud83d\udd17 **[[hardware/nvidia-jetson-thor|Open Hardware Architecture Reference \u2197]]**\n\n### Robotics Superchip Specification\n- **Compute**: Blackwell Tensor Cores (1,000 FP8 TFLOPS @ 100 W)\n- **CPU Complex**: 8-core ARM Neoverse V3AE with ASIL-D safety islands\n- **Application**: Onboard physical AI foundation models for humanoids & arms\n- **Software Stack**: Isaac Lab, ROS 2 Humble/Iron, TensorRT-LLM",
      "x": 1400,
      "y": -380,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-stage5-versal",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \u26a1 HARDWARE | AMD Versal AI Edge Gen 2\n> \ud83d\udd17 **[[hardware/amd-versal-ai-edge-gen2|Open Hardware Architecture Reference \u2197]]**\n\n### Low-Power Deterministic Robotics SoC\n- **Architecture**: AIE-ML v2 Tiles + Cortex-A78AE + Cortex-R52 Lockstep\n- **Compute**: 184 INT8 TOPS @ 25 W deterministic edge envelope\n- **Quantization**: AMD Quark PTQ graph compilation (W4A4 / W8A8)\n- **Safety Profile**: Hardware lockstep with sub-microsecond fault interception",
      "x": 1400,
      "y": -10,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 310,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-stage5-timing",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \u23f1\ufe0f ROBOTIC BUS TIMING & DETERMINISM\n\n### Real-Time Control Loop Budgets\n- **Servo Joint Loop**: $500\\text{ Hz}$ to $1\\text{ kHz}$ joint torque servoing ($<1\\text{ ms}$)\n- **Vision Policy Loop**: $50\\text{ Hz}$ Action Chunk updates ($20\\text{ ms}$ tick)\n- **Inter-Process Transport**: Iceoryx2 zero-copy POSIX shared memory ($<1\\ \\mu\\text{s}$)\n- **Jitter Bound**: P99 latency variance $< 50\\ \\mu\\text{s}$ across all IPC streams",
      "x": 1400,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "5"
    }
